{"step_index":19,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:50:23Z","content":"The modern, interactive Web Application for the **\"Smart City Logistics – Carpooling System\"** has been created.\n\n### 🌐 Files Created\n- [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html): Glassmorphic application layout, 3D city canvas, queues, linked lists, BST canvas, and C++ source code drawer.\n- [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css): 3D mouse anti-gravity tilt physics (`perspective`, `rotateX/Y`, `translateZ`), glowing neon color accents, and responsive layout.\n- [app.js](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/app.js): Full simulation engine implementing:\n  - **Graph & Min-Heap**: Dijkstra shortest route computation with step-by-step priority queue trace.\n  - **Dynamic FIFO Queue**: Passenger queue pipeline with front-to-rear order.\n  - **3D Circular Buffer**: Fixed array size 5 waiting list with modular pointer math (`front`, `rear`, overflow/underflow handling).\n  - **Singly Linked List**: Driver registry with `head` and `next` pointer visualization.\n  - **Hash Table with Chaining**: $O(1)$ driver lookup across 6 buckets.\n  - **Doubly Linked List**: Active rides with bidirectional traversal (`prev <-> next`) and in-place removal.\n  - **Binary Search Tree (BST)**: Tree visualization sorted by Ride ID with live in-order traversal.\n  - **LIFO Stack Undo**: Reversible ride confirmations restoring driver seats and passenger queue state.\n  - **C++ Code Drawer**: Code inspection tabs showing actual C++ struct and class implementations.\n- [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/walkthrough.md): Comprehensive module overview and user guide.\n\nYou can di