{"step_index":39,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:09:20Z","content":"I have created the implementation plan for the **NexusMobility — Smart City Carpooling & Eco-Logistics Platform** in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/implementation_plan.md).\n\n### Key Architectural Highlights:\n1. **100% Zero-Jargon Clean Enterprise Interface**: No academic CS or backend data structure terms anywhere on the UI. Everything is presented in professional transit logistics vocabulary (*\"Optimal Eco-Route Finder\", \"Passenger Dispatch Pipeline\", \"Priority Standby Lounge\", \"Driver Partner Fleet\", \"Active Shared Trips\", \"Revert Last Confirmation\", \"CO₂ Impact Analytics\"*).\n2. **Design System & Theme**: Deep Navy (`#0B172A`), Eco Mint (`#20C9B0`), Electric Blue (`#3478F6`), and crisp Off-White (`#F1F5F9`) with micro-glassmorphism and smooth 3D anti-gravity mouse tilt physics.\n3. **Full Interactive Modules**:\n   - Interactive 3D Spatial Metropolitan Map with live route tracing, travel time, and carbon emission savings.\n   - Dual-mode passenger dispatch (real-time pipeline + 5-slot priority standby lounge with auto-dispatch).\n   - Driver fleet onboarding with real-time seat tracking and instant verification search.\n   - Active shared trips console with bidirectional trip management and one-click trip reversal.\n   - Live sustainability metrics and eco-driver leaderboard.\n   - Built-in one-click ZIP exporter.\n\nPlease review the plan and click **Proceed** or let me know if you would like any specific adjustments."}
