{"step_index":43,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:11:13Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete styles.css for NexusMobility with deep navy theme, eco-mint and electric-blue accents, micro-glassmorphism, and responsive 3D anti-gravity tilt physics.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   NEXUSMOBILITY — ENTERPRISE URBAN CARPOOLING & ECO-LOGISTICS PLATFORM\n   Clean Corporate Dark Theme, Micro-Glassmorphism, & 3D Tilt Physics\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n  --navy-deep: #0B172A;\n  --navy-surface: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78);\n  --navy-surface-hover: rgba(22, 33, 58, 0.9);\n  --navy-border: rgba(52, 120, 246, 0.16);\n  --navy-border-hover: rgba(32, 201, 176, 0.45);\n\n  --mint: #20C9B0;\n  --mint-glow: rgba(32, 201, 176, 0.35);\n  --electric: #3478F6;\n  --electric-glow: rgba(52, 120, 246, 0.35);\n  --purple: #A855F7;\n  --purple-glow: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);\n  --amber: #F59E0B;\n  --amber-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);\n  --rose: #F43F5E;\n  --rose-glow: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35);\n\n  --slate-50: #F8FAFC;\n  --slate-100: #F1F5F9;\n  --slate-200: #E2E8F0;\n  --slate-300: #CBD5E1;\n  --slate-400: #94A3B8;\n  --slate-500: #64748B;\n  --slate-600: #475569;\n\n  --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: var(--navy-deep);\n  color: var(--slate-100);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  overflow-x: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  perspective: 1200px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n/* Scrollbars */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: rgba(11, 23, 42, 0.9);\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: rgba(52, 120, 246, 0.35);\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: var(--mint);\n}\n\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Layout Shell & Micro-Glassmorphism\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n.app